<title>USA: BOXING-CARBAJAL RETAINS IBF JR FLYWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-CARBAJAL RETAINS IBF JR FLYWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ANAHEIM, California 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Michael Carbajal stopped Tomas Rivera at 1:26 of the fifth round on Saturday to retain his International Boxing Federation junior flyweight title.</p>
</text>
